# Writer boundary of the field history rows.
# Format: path|function|families|reason
# families: H field history (rh:, ahq:, ahk:, ahb:) rows · - none of these
# One line for each function that the lint finds. The lint fails on a function that is missing,
# on a function that names a family the line does not list, and on a line that no function matches.

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/field_history/policy.rs|set_field_history_policy|H|writes only a canonical field policy and the home's field-history layout marker in one native transaction; no history row write


fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/delete_replay.rs|raise_replay_cutoff|-|explicit stopped-home maintenance (`lastdb db recount --delete-cutoff-unix-secs`): puts the one replay cutoff row; no record or history row

fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/counter/commit.rs|commit_guarded_deletes|-|the guarded row commit: deletes the keys that still hold the bytes the caller read, in one batch_mutate that joins the pending batch of the request; the retirement of a queue bucket


fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/erase_meters.rs|record_record_delete_audit|-|final dellog audit facts only, optionally database-prefixed; staged in the same native batch as the erase, with no record or counter keys

fold_db/crates/core/src/storage/format/records/mod.rs|stage|-|consumes the format-minted opaque rk:/ak: batch inside the coordinator's existing write scope; never starts or commits an independent request
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/records.rs|stage_records|-|stages the opaque record/alternate batch, then the still-unmigrated history rows and record-file effects in the same private native request; raw history cannot be appended to the opaque record batch
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/field_history/records.rs|commit_history_release|-|releases rh: field history copies with their ahq: queue entries and ahk: count rows in one native batch; no record, archive row or record counter
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/field_history/release.rs|release_dropped_history|-|schema drop: releases the rh: field history copies of a dropped schema with their ahq: queue entries, deletes their ahk: count rows in one native batch, inside the write scope of one release batch; no record, archive row or record counter
fold_db/crates/core/src/db_operations/record_store/schema_release.rs|release_batch|-|schema drop: in one write scope, reads one bounded batch of the rk: records or ak: entries of a dropped schema again by key and deletes them in one native batch, then deletes the file paths of those records in that batch
